  "worked_solution": "Using the identity $1+{cot}^{2}\u2061\\theta ={csc}^{2}\u2061\\theta ,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{csc}^{2}\u2061\\theta }{\\operatorname{cot}\u2061\\theta }-\\operatorname{cot}\u2061\\theta  & =\\frac{{csc}^{2}\u2061\\theta -{cot}^{2}\u2061\\theta }{\\operatorname{cot}\u2061\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{1+{cot}^{2}\u2061\\theta -{cot}^{2}\u2061\\theta }{\\operatorname{cot}\u2061\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cot}\u2061\\theta } \\\\  & =\\operatorname{tan}\u2061\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
